# What a golden-set run is called in Phoenix.
#
# Optional, and its absence means something: unset, the runner names the
# experiment after the model it scored, which is what makes two runs of
# two models comparable without anybody typing anything. Set it when the
# model is the same and something else changed - a prompt, a temperature,
# a quantisation - because then the model name is not what tells them
# apart.
#
#     make eval-score EVAL_RUN_NAME=extraction-prompt-v7
# EVAL_RUN_NAME=
